    <description>Screen flow launched via quick action from a GiftCommitment record. Presents only the manage-gift-commitment actions valid for the commitment&apos;s current state, then hands off to the matching frops_flow managed subflow. State detection reads GC.Status, GC.FQS_Gift_Commitment_Category__c, GC.CurrentGiftCmtScheduleId, plus two side queries: Get_Active_Pause (any live PauseTransactions GCS) and Get_Live_Create_Schedules (any CreateTransactions GCS with StartDate&lt;=today AND EndDate null or &gt;=today). Six states: CLOSED / RECURRING_PAUSED / NO_SCHEDULE_YET / RECURRING_ACTIVE / OPEN_INSTALLMENT_PLEDGE / ONE_TIME_OR_SETTLED. Each state routes to a dedicated screen with a hand-authored radio button field listing only the cards valid for that state (static choices, no CMDT). OPEN_INSTALLMENT_PLEDGE covers open multi-installment pledges AND grant payouts on a ladder — same action set (no Pause/Resume, since there is no drumbeat to interrupt). ONE_TIME_OR_SETTLED covers single-installment gifts and fully-paid pledges — they get Manage Designations + Close only. Two subflows (frops_flow__PauseResumeSchedule, frops_flow__UpdateRecurringSchedule) accept an `action` input; this flow exposes those as five distinct cards. CLOSED lands on Screen_Closed — no actions offered.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Derives the commitment&apos;s current state from Get_GC, Get_Active_Pause, and Get_Live_Create_Schedules. Evaluation order matters: Closed short-circuits first; Paused (via either live PauseTransactions row OR GC.Status=Paused) second; NO_SCHEDULE_YET requires BOTH CurrentGiftCmtScheduleId blank AND no live CreateTransactions row (guards against a stale lookup pointing at a schedule that was deleted or expired); ONE_TIME_OR_SETTLED fires when CurrentGiftCmtScheduleId is populated but no live create row remains (single-installment gifts / fully-paid pledges); then FQS_Gift_Commitment_Category__c disambiguates recurring vs open installment pledge or grant.</description>
        <name>frmContext</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISPICKVAL({!Get_GC.Status}, &quot;Closed&quot;), &quot;CLOSED&quot;,
IF(OR(NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_Active_Pause.Id})), ISPICKVAL({!Get_GC.Status}, &quot;Paused&quot;)), &quot;RECURRING_PAUSED&quot;,
IF(AND(ISBLANK({!Get_GC.CurrentGiftCmtScheduleId}), ISBLANK({!Get_Live_Create_Schedules.Id})), &quot;NO_SCHEDULE_YET&quot;,
IF(ISBLANK({!Get_Live_Create_Schedules.Id}), &quot;ONE_TIME_OR_SETTLED&quot;,
IF(TEXT({!Get_GC.FQS_Gift_Commitment_Category__c}) = &quot;Recurring Gift&quot;, &quot;RECURRING_ACTIVE&quot;,
&quot;OPEN_INSTALLMENT_PLEDGE&quot;)))))</expression>
    </formulas>
